# Project 02: Push-Button Controlled LED Using ESP32

## Overview

This project focuses on controlling an external LED using a physical push button connected to an ESP32 microcontroller.

Unlike Project 01, where the LED blinked automatically, this project introduces digital input handling and demonstrates how a microcontroller responds to external signals.

**Objective:** Turn the LED ON when the push button is pressed and OFF when it is released.

