## Circuit Connections

### LED Circuit

| ESP32 Pin | Connection |
|---|---|
| GPIO 23 (D23) | 220Ω resistor |
| Resistor | LED anode (+) |
| LED cathode (−) | GND |

### Push Button Circuit

| ESP32 Pin | Connection |
|---|---|
| GPIO 18 (D18) | One switched contact of push button |
| GND | Other switched contact of push button |

The LED and push button share a common GND connection.

The button is configured using the ESP32's internal pull-up resistor, so no additional external pull-up resistor is required.

